\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {t-SNE Latent Space Visualization of Learned Multi-Modal Representations.} The 2D manifold projection demonstrates clear cluster separation across distinct musical genres and mood profiles. Classical and Jazz occupy coherent, well-defined manifolds in the upper projection space, while high-energy Metal and Rock form tight clusters driven by harmonic distortion and rhythmic topology. The smooth transitional boundaries between Pop and Disco illustrate the model's nuanced contextual understanding.}}{8}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:tsne}{{2}{8}{\textbf {t-SNE Latent Space Visualization of Learned Multi-Modal Representations.} The 2D manifold projection demonstrates clear cluster separation across distinct musical genres and mood profiles. Classical and Jazz occupy coherent, well-defined manifolds in the upper projection space, while high-energy Metal and Rock form tight clusters driven by harmonic distortion and rhythmic topology. The smooth transitional boundaries between Pop and Disco illustrate the model's nuanced contextual understanding}{figure.2}{}}
